<http://data.silknow.org/object/1b31d682-266d-337c-b643-a5d9441bc035>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "A woman's shoe with black leather upper, brown leather sole and white leather covered wood heel.  The shoe has a set-under heel and pointed toe.  It is edged with black silk ribbon and trimmed with two rows of ruched black silk ribbon over the toe and a bow each of black and white silk.  The black leather over the toe is cut away in long narrow triangles revealing white grosgrain silk underneath."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/32c9ad18-ad9c-3159-b776-36b5e6841f65> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "A woman's shoe with black leather upper, brown leather sole and white leather covered wood heel.  The shoe has a set-under heel and pointed toe.  It is edged with black silk ribbon and trimmed with two rows of ruched black silk ribbon over the toe and a bow each of black and white silk.  The black leather over the toe is cut away in long narrow triangles revealing white grosgrain silk underneath."@en ;
